Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 23:37:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20=E5=A2=9E=E5=BC=BATUI=E4=B8=AD=E7=9A=84?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E4=BC=9A=E8=AF=9D=E5=A4=84=E7=90=86=E5=92=8C=E9=94=99=E8=AF=AF?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=81=A2=E5=A4=8D?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Introduced ConnectionError utility to classify connection-related errors.
- Updated Session component to handle recoverable connection errors without navigating away.
- Refactored thread management to improve daemon spawning and recovery logic.
- Added tests for SDKProvider to ensure proper URL rebinding and SSE stream handling.
- Enhanced session processor to handle tool call states more robustly.
- Improved error handling in prompt processing, ensuring agents are validated before execution.
- Updated daemon tests to ensure proper isolation and signal handling.
- Added tests for concurrent daemon recovery to ensure single replacement worker is elected.

